{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《玩住學。學住玩》最新一集，賴慰玲（Winki）為咗囝囝也也竟做出驚人舉動！佢喺鏡頭前挑戰人生最大關口，將一條肥美嘅西米蟲放入口中，場面極度衝擊！Winki事後形容口感，究竟呢位虎媽背後有咩苦心？\n</p>\n<h2>賴慰玲婆羅州文化村挑戰食蟲 為囝囝以身作則</h2>\n<p>喺最新一集節目中，賴慰玲同囝囝也也到訪婆羅州文化村，體驗當地獵頭族原住民嘅生活。此行其中一個重大挑戰，就係Winki要喺囝囝面前示範「食蟲」。Winki坦言呢個係佢人生最大挑戰，更解釋背後苦心：「如果自己去旅行，一定唔食。但喺也也面前想畀佢知，可以接受挑戰試新嘢，人生苦短咩都試下。」畫面中所見，Winki將條仍然肥美蠕動嘅西米蟲放喺掌心，面露難色，經過一輪激烈嘅心理掙扎後，最終都鼓起勇氣，一嘢將肥蟲放入口中咀嚼，表情猙獰，畫面極具衝擊力，完全睇得出佢為咗囝囝真係豁出去！</p>\n<h2>Winki形容口感似提子 坦言重點克服心理障礙</h2>\n<p>成功挑戰極限後，Winki亦大方分享食後感。佢形容嗰條西米蟲食落口嘅感覺，竟然出奇地唔差，口感好似提子一樣，咬落去相當鬆軟。不過，佢強調味道同口感都係其次，呢次挑戰最重要嘅部分，其實係克服內心巨大嘅心理障礙。能夠喺囝囝面前完成呢個壯舉，向佢展示咩叫勇氣同挑戰精神，對Winki嚟講先係最大嘅收穫。呢次經歷唔單止係一個簡單嘅試食，更加係一次深刻嘅身教，用行動話畀囝囝知，面對未知嘅事物，只要鼓起勇氣就可以戰勝恐懼。</p>\n<h2>母子體驗獵頭族生活 也也學識鑽木取火</h2>\n<p>其實今次賴慰玲母子嘅婆羅州文化村之旅，目的就係要畀囝囝也也認識人類嘅基本生存技能。除咗Winki挑戰食蟲之外，也也亦都有自己嘅學習任務。喺當地原住民嘅指導下，也也親身體驗鑽木取火嘅古老智慧，學習喺冇現代工具嘅情況下點樣生火，過程非常投入。整個行程充滿教育意義，透過體驗獵頭族嘅生活方式，母子二人一齊學習同成長。而食蟲呢個環節，就成為咗呢趟學習之旅中，對作為母親嘅Winki最大嘅一個考驗，亦都係最深刻嘅一課。</p>\n<h2>網民睇到毛骨悚然 大讚Winki係最強虎媽</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，賴慰玲生吞肥蟲一幕即時引起網民極大迴響，唔少觀眾都話睇到毛骨悚然，但同時亦都一面倒大讚Winki嘅勇氣！有網民留言話：「睇到都想嘔！真係好大犧牲！」、「條蟲仲郁緊…Winki真係好大膽！」、「我絕對做唔到，為咗個仔真係咩都得。」不過更多人佩服佢嘅身教方式：「呢啲身教先係最重要，respect！」、「最強虎媽！唔係淨係哦個仔，係自己做一次畀佢睇！」、「睇得出佢真係好錫也也，呢個媽媽好偉大。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6_12267772066ae037f3e830f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6_12267772066ae037f3e830f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7_3152793816ae037fb39e43.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7_3152793816ae037fb39e43.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/8_9483882596ae0380123754.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/8_9483882596ae0380123754.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/9_15972387896ae03809150fb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/9_15972387896ae03809150fb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_6537625866ae03815dd2da.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_6537625866ae03815dd2da.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_18740820786ae0382012eb4.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_18740820786ae0382012eb4.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_15897525616ae0382f42c6d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_15897525616ae0382f42c6d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_5605579816ae03841519e6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_5605579816ae03841519e6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_8029861256ae038507eab5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_8029861256ae038507eab5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_6407087926ae03858d002a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_6407087926ae03858d002a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_10833602676ae0386d530e5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_10833602676ae0386d530e5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_18449269886ae03876a7cd2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_18449269886ae03876a7cd2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_16406353906ae03883b22b3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_16406353906ae03883b22b3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:01:35.501719+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1400,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:30:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T08:19:12.038479+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:37.315508+00:00","content_hash":"a2492b0794e5524a6a7c9fb8dad0aafc1f80472f72dc9900854df67a59d13314","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}